 "grammar": {
  "title": {
   "ko": "verbos con partícula y pronominales: levantarse, apagar, encender, recoger, volver",
   "en": "verbs with particles and reflexives: levantarse, apagar, encender, recoger, volver"
  },
  "explain": {
   "ko": "스페인어에는 영어의 구동사 대신 접두어와 재귀동사가 많습니다: levantarse, acostarse, encender(켜다) ↔ apagar(끄다), recoger(치우다), volver(돌아오다), llenar(채우다). 재귀동사는 me, te, se, nos, os, se와 함께 씁니다: Me levanto. Date prisa.",
   "en": "Spanish uses prefixed and reflexive verbs where English uses phrasal verbs: levantarse, acostarse, encender (turn on) ↔ apagar (turn off), recoger (pick up), volver (come back), llenar (fill in). Reflexives take me, te, se, nos, os, se: Me levanto. Date prisa."
  },
